   "segment": "Africa",
   "country": "Western Sahara / Morocco",
   "text": "The [[p:United Nations Mission for the Referendum in Western Sahara|UN's Western Sahara mission (MINURSO)]] {{note: Set up by the Security Council in 1991 to monitor the Morocco–Polisario ceasefire and organise a referendum that never took place.}} ended after 35 years. Russia vetoed a US draft backing Morocco's autonomy plan, a Russian rollover failed, and liquidation began on 1 Nov.",
